    Excellent. **Phase 2 is where Linux starts becoming "real."**
    
    In Phase 1, you learned **how to use Linux**.
    
    In Phase 2, you'll learn **how Linux protects files and controls access**.
    
    This is one of the most asked topics in:
    
    - SDE interviews
    - DevOps interviews
    - Linux Administrator interviews
    - Cloud (AWS/Azure/GCP)
    - Docker & Kubernetes
    
    ---
    
